   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Hedging\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d592a240",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Question 8: Hedging at date $t_{N-1}$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Setting up the system of equations\n",
    "\n",
    "At date $t_{N-1}$, let $x = S_{t_{N-1}}^{(N)}$ be the price of the risky asset.\n",
    "\n",
    "At the terminal date $t_N = T$, the risky asset can take two possible values:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Up move: $S_{t_N}^{(N)} = (1 + h_N)\\,x$\n",
    "- Down move: $S_{t_N}^{(N)} = (1 + b_N)\\,x$\n",
    "\n",
    "For the hedging portfolio to perfectly replicate the option payoff $f(S_{t_N}^{(N)})$ in every event at the terminal date $T$, the portfolio value must equal the option value in both cases. This gives the system of two linear equations in two unknowns $(\\alpha_{N-1}(x), \\beta_{N-1}(x))$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "\\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + h_N)\\,x + \\beta_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^N = f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) & \\text{(Eq. 1: up move)} \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "\\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + b_N)\\,x + \\beta_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^N = f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big) & \\text{(Eq. 2: down move)}\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Solving the system\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step A: finding $\\alpha_{N-1}(x)$ (number of risky assets)\n",
    "\n",
    "Subtract equation 2 from equation 1 to eliminate the $\\beta_{N-1}(x)$ term:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + h_N)\\,x - \\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + b_N)\\,x = f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Factor out $\\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\cdot x$ on the left-hand side:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\cdot x\\cdot\\Big[(1 + h_N) - (1 + b_N)\\Big] = f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\cdot x\\cdot(h_N - b_N) = f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Since $h_N > b_N$ and $x > 0$, the term $x(h_N - b_N)$ is nonzero. Isolate $\\alpha_{N-1}(x)$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\\;\\alpha_{N-1}(x) = \\dfrac{f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)}{x\\,(h_N - b_N)}\\;}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step B: finding $\\beta_{N-1}(x)$ (number of riskless assets)\n",
    "\n",
    "Take equation 1 and isolate the $\\beta_{N-1}(x)$ term:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\beta_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^N = f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - \\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + h_N)\\,x\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Dividing by $(1 + r_N)^N$ gives a first form:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\beta_{N-1}(x) = \\dfrac{f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - \\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + h_N)\\,x}{(1 + r_N)^N}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Substituting the expression for $\\alpha_{N-1}(x)$ from step A and reducing to a common denominator:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\beta_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^N = f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - \\left[\\dfrac{f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)}{x\\,(h_N - b_N)}\\right](1 + h_N)\\,x\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\beta_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^N = \\dfrac{f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big)(h_N - b_N) - (1 + h_N)f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) + (1 + h_N)f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)}{h_N - b_N}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Simplifying the numerator:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big)\\cdot\\Big[(h_N - b_N) - (1 + h_N)\\Big] + (1 + h_N)f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "= -(1 + b_N)f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) + (1 + h_N)f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "This yields the final explicit expression:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\\;\\beta_{N-1}(x) = \\dfrac{(1 + h_N)f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big) - (1 + b_N)f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big)}{(1 + r_N)^N\\,(h_N - b_N)}\\;}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "The system of equations describing the hedge at date $t_{N-1}$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "\\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + h_N)\\,x + \\beta_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^N = f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) \\\\[4pt]\n",
    "\\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + b_N)\\,x + \\beta_{N-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^N = f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "has the unique solution given by the pair:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "\\alpha_{N-1}(x) = \\dfrac{f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)}{x\\,(h_N - b_N)} \\\\[12pt]\n",
    "\\beta_{N-1}(x) = \\dfrac{(1 + h_N)f\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big) - (1 + b_N)f\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big)}{(1 + r_N)^N\\,(h_N - b_N)}\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "- $\\alpha_{N-1}(x)$ is the **Delta**: the discrete slope between the change in option price and the change in the underlying.\n",
    "- $\\beta_{N-1}(x)$ is the **discounted cash amount** invested or borrowed at the riskless rate.\n",
    "\n",
    "$\\beta_{N-1}(x)$ can also be written in terms of the option value $v_{N-1}(x)$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\beta_{N-1}(x) = \\dfrac{v_{N-1}(x) - \\alpha_{N-1}(x)\\cdot x}{(1 + r_N)^{N-1}}\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "17024e0b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Question 9: Hedging at an intermediate date $t_{k-1}$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. System of equations\n",
    "\n",
    "At date $t_{k-1}$, let $x = S_{t_{k-1}}^{(N)}$ be the price of the risky asset. The portfolio must now replicate the option value $v_k$ at the next date $t_k$ (instead of the final payoff $f$). Replacing the index $N$ by $k$ and the payoff $f$ by $v_k$ in the Question 8 system:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "\\alpha_{k-1}(x)\\,(1 + h_N)\\,x + \\beta_{k-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^k = v_k\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) & \\text{(up move)} \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "\\alpha_{k-1}(x)\\,(1 + b_N)\\,x + \\beta_{k-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^k = v_k\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big) & \\text{(down move)}\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Solving the system\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step A: finding $\\alpha_{k-1}(x)$\n",
    "\n",
    "Subtract the down equation from the up equation to eliminate $\\beta_{k-1}(x)$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\alpha_{k-1}(x)\\cdot x\\cdot(h_N - b_N) = v_k\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - v_k\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Since $h_N > b_N$ and $x > 0$, isolate $\\alpha_{k-1}(x)$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\\;\\alpha_{k-1}(x) = \\dfrac{v_k\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - v_k\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)}{x\\,(h_N - b_N)}\\;}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step B: finding $\\beta_{k-1}(x)$\n",
    "\n",
    "From the up equation:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\beta_{k-1}(x)\\,(1 + r_N)^k = v_k\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - \\alpha_{k-1}(x)\\,(1 + h_N)\\,x\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Substituting $\\alpha_{k-1}(x)$ and reducing to a common denominator, the numerator simplifies to:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "-(1 + b_N)v_k\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) + (1 + h_N)v_k\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "This yields the final explicit expression:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\\;\\beta_{k-1}(x) = \\dfrac{(1 + h_N)v_k\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big) - (1 + b_N)v_k\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big)}{(1 + r_N)^k\\,(h_N - b_N)}\\;}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "\\alpha_{k-1}(x) = \\dfrac{v_k\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big) - v_k\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big)}{x\\,(h_N - b_N)} \\\\[12pt]\n",
    "\\beta_{k-1}(x) = \\dfrac{(1 + h_N)v_k\\big((1 + b_N)\\,x\\big) - (1 + b_N)v_k\\big((1 + h_N)\\,x\\big)}{(1 + r_N)^k\\,(h_N - b_N)}\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Question 8 is the special case $k = N$, where $v_N = f$.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Alternative form for $\\beta_{k-1}(x)$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\beta_{k-1}(x) = \\dfrac{v_{k-1}(x) - \\alpha_{k-1}(x)\\cdot x}{(1 + r_N)^{k-1}}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## 4. Mapping to array indices (for coding)\n",
    "\n",
    "At node $(k-1, j)$ with price $x = s(1+h_N)^j(1+b_N)^{k-1-j}$:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $v_k\\big((1+h_N)x\\big)$ = up child = `V[j+1]`\n",
    "- $v_k\\big((1+b_N)x\\big)$ = down child = `V[j]`\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "alpha = (V_up - V_down) / (x * (hN - bN))\n",
    "beta  = ((1 + hN) * V_down - (1 + bN) * V_up) / ((1 + rN)**k * (hN - bN))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 51,
   "id": "af4db8c7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def hedge(N, rN, hN, bN, s, f):\n",
    "    alpha = []  \n",
    "    beta = []\n",
    "\n",
    "    for k in range(1, N + 1):          \n",
    "        alpha_k = []\n",
    "        beta_k = []\n",
    "        for j in range(k):             \n",
    "            x = s * (1 + hN)**j * (1 + bN)**(k - 1 - j)   \n",
    "\n",
    "            v_up   = price2(N - k, rN, hN, bN, (1 + hN) * x, f)[0]\n",
    "            v_down = price2(N - k, rN, hN, bN, (1 + bN) * x, f)[0]\n",
    "\n",
    "            a = (v_up - v_down) / (x * (hN - bN))\n",
    "            b = ((1 + hN) * v_down - (1 + bN) * v_up) / ((1 + rN)**k * (hN - bN))\n",
    "\n",
    "            alpha_k.append(a)\n",
    "            beta_k.append(b)\n",
    "\n",
    "        alpha.append(alpha_k)\n",
    "        beta.append(beta_k)\n",
    "\n",
    "    return alpha, beta"
   ]
  },
